# New Horizons: "You can cast New Horizons even if you control no creatures" (its ruling): the trigger has no target and is removed
# (CR 603.3d), and the Aura still enters. "Enchanted land has "{T}: Add two mana of any one color."": the land is Bot2's Maze of Ith, so
# Bot2, its controller, taps it for two mana of one color; Bot1, who controls the Aura but not the land, can't.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
New Horizons
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Maze of Ith
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Maze of Ith.Play
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Green)
Bot1.Hand.New Horizons.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Maze of Ith)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Mana = 
! Bot1.Battlefield.Maze of Ith.Activate
[T4 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Battlefield.Maze of Ith.Activate(Color: Red)
? Bot2.Mana = {R}{R}

[Expect]
Bot2.Battlefield.Maze of Ith.Tapped = true
